+
+#### [Langflow](https://github.com/langflow-ai/langflow)
+> **Description:** Langflow presents itself as a platform for building and deploying AI-powered agents and workflows with both a visual authoring experience and built-in API and MCP servers. The README emphasizes quick prototyping, source-level customization in Python, observability, vector database support, and deployment as APIs or tools. That maps cleanly to brokerage use cases like an office knowledge assistant, a property research co-pilot, or an intake flow that turns listing or buyer questions into structured data. GitHub lists the project as MIT licensed, primarily Python, with about 147k stars and a latest visible commit dated April 3, 2026.
+
