+#### [LibreChat](https://github.com/danny-avila/LibreChat)
+> **Description:** LibreChat is a self-hosted multi-model chat interface with agents, MCP support, web search, file handling, code execution, presets, and secure multi-user access. The README highlights support for local and remote model providers, assistant-style workflows, search, artifact generation, and team sharing. For real estate operators, it can act as a private workspace for drafting listing copy, summarizing inspection reports, answering policy questions, or reviewing comp notes with local or hosted models. GitHub shows a MIT license, TypeScript as the main language, roughly 35.2k stars, and a latest visible commit on March 29, 2026.
