+> **Description:** Dify is positioned as a production-ready platform for LLM application development that combines AI workflow, RAG, agent capabilities, model management, and observability. Its README leans toward moving quickly from prototype to production with a polished interface and self-hosting flow. That makes it relevant to real estate groups building lead bots, brokerage assistants, or listing/document copilots without assembling every component from scratch. GitHub shows it is primarily TypeScript, has around 136k stars, and had its latest visible commit on March 31, 2026. The important caveat is licensing: GitHub lists a Dify Open Source License based on Apache-2.0 with additional conditions.
